{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "早想好了救火办法  (Executives Beg Chun Yuqiao to Save the Show)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Hearing footsteps outside, Bu Xiaogu guesses the panicked executives are coming to beg Chun Yuqiao to put out the fire. Once they hand him full authority, Xiaogu realises he already has a bold rescue plan ready. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "听这动静，好像全公司的人跑来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你是不是又想去帮他们救火了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "听你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小心，要不你还是别去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是早就想好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "雨下来有多大？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "半个小时就超过了五十毫米，也就是前所未有的大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你看的不是旧报纸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总，现在有什么办法？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "试试吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我批准你，别着凉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是把我拉黑了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我今天下午又把你也拉回来了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "听这动静，好像全公司的人跑来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Judging from the commotion, it sounds like the whole company just came running.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你是不是又想去帮他们救火了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you itching to go put out their fire again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "听你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will listen to you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小心，要不你还是别去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Careful—maybe you really should not go after all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是早就想好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not already make up your mind to let me go?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "雨下来有多大？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How heavy is the rainfall outside?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "半个小时就超过了五十毫米，也就是前所未有的大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over fifty millimetres fell in half an hour—an unprecedented downpour.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你看的不是旧报纸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So what you have been checking is live weather data, not old newspapers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总，现在有什么办法？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, what plan do we have now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "试试吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us give it a shot.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我批准你，别着凉了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I give you my approval—just do not catch a chill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是把我拉黑了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not block me from the chat?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我今天下午又把你也拉回来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I added you right back into the group this afternoon!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "听这动静，好像全公司的人跑来了。",
      "gap": 0.5
